# Python Project Tasks
# Copy to project root as .tasks

# Setup
0|Install|pip install -r requirements.txt|Install dependencies
0|Venv|python3 -m venv venv && source venv/bin/activate|Create virtual environment
0|Update|pip install --upgrade pip && pip install -r requirements.txt|Update dependencies

# Development
0|Run|python main.py|Run application
0|Dev Server|python manage.py runserver|Run Django development server
0|Shell|python -i main.py|Interactive Python shell

# Quality
0|Quality|SUB|Code quality tools
1|Lint|pylint src/|Lint code (pylint)
1|Format|black src/|Format code (black)
1|Type Check|mypy src/|Type checking (mypy)
1|QA|pylint src/ && black src/ && mypy src/ [depends: Lint,Format,Type Check]|Full quality check
1|Back|BACK

# Testing
0|Testing|SUB|Test suite
1|Test Unit|pytest tests/|Unit tests
1|Test Cov|pytest --cov=src tests/|Coverage report
1|Test All|pytest tests/ --cov=src|Full test suite
1|Back|BACK

# Database
0|Database|SUB|Database operations
1|DB Migrate|python manage.py migrate|Run migrations
1|DB Shell|python manage.py dbshell|Database shell
1|DB Reset|python manage.py migrate zero && python manage.py migrate|Reset database
1|Back|BACK

# Documentation
0|Docs|SUB|Documentation
1|Docs Build|sphinx-build -b html docs/ docs/_build/|Build docs
1|Docs Serve|python -m http.server -d docs/_build/ 8000|Serve docs
1|Back|BACK

# Deployment
0|Deployment|SUB|Deployment tasks
1|Build|python setup.py sdist bdist_wheel|Build distribution
1|Upload|twine upload dist/*|Upload to PyPI
1|Deploy|docker build -t app:latest . && docker push app:latest|Deploy container
1|Back|BACK

0|Exit|EXIT|Close menu
